  "description": "Beatrice, the eldest daughter of a noble family, moves into the home of her fiancé, Fenric, to live with him, following her family’s orders. However, the affectionate boy she once knew is nowhere to be found, and as Beatrice struggles to win his heart, she discovers by chance that Fenric is a werewolf…\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)\n\n*Note: Part of CNC Revolution's Jipjungmaking Danpyeonseon (집중마킹 단편선) Collection.*",
